'''Leviathan''' is a [[transformation]] added in ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth]]'', turning Isaac into a [[wikipedia:Lovecraftian horror|Lovecraftian horror]] after picking up 3 devil-related items.

== Effects ==
* Grants 2 {{e|Black Heart}}s and [[flight]].

== Requirements ==
Pick up 3 [[item]]s from the following list ({{dlc|r}} with the [[Item Tags devil|{{code|devil}} tag]]).

=== Activated Collectibles ===
{{collectible table | The Nail, Sulfur }}

=== Passive Collectibles ===
{{collectible table/header}}
{{collectible rows | Abaddon, Brimstone, The Mark, The Pact, Pentagram, Spirit of the Night, Maw Of The Void }}
{{collectible rows | dlc = r | Eye of the Occult, Lord of the Pit }}
|}

== Notes ==
* {{I|Sanguine Bond}}'s spikes have a 2% chance to transform Isaac into Leviathan.

